            }
        ]
    },
    "welcome": {
        "message": "The USDA has proposed rescinding the 2001 Roadless Area Conservation Rule, and quoted several figures in support of it. This map holds the underlying data so you can check them yourself. Every percentage depends on which acreage base it is computed against — ask, and the assistant will say which one it used. See \"About\" below for sources and the four competing denominators. Try asking:",
        "examples": [
            "How many roadless acres would the proposal affect, and how does that differ from all inventoried roadless acres?",
            "Which states hold the most rule-affected roadless acreage, and what share is in the ten Western states?",
            "How much rule-affected roadless area has a completed Forest Service treatment recorded since FY2014?",
            "What share of rule-affected roadless area has high or very high wildfire hazard potential, and does that match the agency's >40% claim?"
        ]
    },
    "links": {
        "github": "https://github.com/cassiebuhler/roadless-rule",
        "docs": "https://github.com/cassiebuhler/roadless-rule/blob/main/DATA-SOURCES.md"
    },
